sizeof(pthread_attr_t) = 56
PTHREAD_STACK_MIN = 16384 字节，页大小 = 4096 字节
RLIMIT_STACK 软限制 = 8388608 字节
线程栈默认值取自进程启动时的 RLIMIT_STACK
默认属性：
  stacksize   = 8388608 字节（8192 KiB）
  guardsize   = 4096 字节
  detachstate = PTHREAD_CREATE_JOINABLE
  schedpolicy = SCHED_OTHER
  inheritsched= PTHREAD_INHERIT_SCHED
  scope       = PTHREAD_SCOPE_SYSTEM
setscope(PTHREAD_SCOPE_PROCESS) = 95（Operation not supported）
设置 1 MiB 栈和 8 KiB 保护区之后：
  stacksize   = 1048576 字节（1024 KiB）
  guardsize   = 8192 字节
  detachstate = PTHREAD_CREATE_JOINABLE
  schedpolicy = SCHED_OTHER
  inheritsched= PTHREAD_INHERIT_SCHED
  scope       = PTHREAD_SCOPE_SYSTEM
